<title>DUBAI: Qatar and Turkmenistan establish diplomatic ties.</title>
<headline>Qatar and Turkmenistan establish diplomatic ties.</headline>
<dateline>DUBAI 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Gulf Arab state of Qatar and the Central Asian republic of Turkmenistan established diplomatic relations on Friday, the official Qatar News Agency (QNA) reported.</p>
<p>It said the two countries' permanent envoys at the United Nations signed an accord in New York to establish ties at ambassadorial level.</p>
</text>
